nd forget.\r\n\r\nTo make this work properly, ProjectSettings can now access EditorSettings (via a plain Object pointer). I added `GLOBAL_EDITOR_DEF` and `GLOBAL_EDITOR_GET`, intended for editor settings that need to be accessed in the project. The caveat is that editor settings are not available at runtime .-. In such case, the project override will be used, if available. If not available, the editor setting's value is ignored and I don't know how to fix that :/\r\n\r\nI also added compatibility code that automatically adds project overrides for old settings.","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098082,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwODI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gdscript","name":"topic:gdscript","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2025-06-05T15:16:51Z","updated_at":"2025-06-11T11:30:13Z","closed_at":"2025-06-11T11:29:14Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"d2b680e83498edd8a35042c80cfb2f174981e1b2","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"KoBeWi:settings_of_project_editor","ref":"settings_of_project_editor","repo":{"id":144194391,"node_id":"MDEwOlJlcG9zaXRvcnkxNDQxOTQzOTE=","name":"godo